STAGE 3: CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE
Redesign Home, Explore, Cart, Messages and the complete customer profile.

STAGE 4: PRODUCT DISCOVERY
Improve product pages, red fault indicators, search, filters, accessories and free gift promotions.

STAGE 5: VENDOR EXPERIENCE
Redesign vendor registration, sign-in, dashboard, inventory, orders, messages, storefront and promotions.

STAGE 6: BUYER PROTECTION
Implement the minimum 24-hour inspection workflow and dispute interface.

STAGE 7: DEMO ENVIRONMENT
Add realistic products, vendors, reviews, accessories, promotional campaigns and working demo interactions.

STAGE 8: TESTING
Test every screen and interaction on mobile, tablet and desktop.

After each stage, check that existing working features remain functional.

